---
import External from './external.svg';
---

<header transition:persist>
  <div class="title" id="about-link">
    <h1>Goodison.Memorial</h1>
    <div class="info">
      <p>Goodison Park, built as the home of Everton Football Club in 1892, became the first purpose built football stadium in the world.</p>
      <p>After 133 years, as the Everton men’s team now prepares to begin a new chapter at their new home at Bramley Moore Dock for the 2025 to 26 season, the stadium will become the home of Everton Women.</p>
      <p>As a lasting legacy to commemorate Goodison Park to date, we have archived and contextualised all fan clips captured over the years to create a digital place. This will be the first digital stadium, allowing fans to relive memories whenever they want. </p>
      <p class="table">
        <span class="heading">Initiator</span><span><a href="https://www.rensvanstrien.com/" target="_blank">Rens van Strien <External /></a></span>
        <span class="heading">Design</span><span><a href="https://www.ilyaschulte.com/" target="_blank">Ilya Schulte <External /></a></span>
        <span class="heading">Technology</span><span><a href="https://www.andrewthomashill.co.uk" target="_blank">Andrew Hill <External /></a></span>
        <span class="heading">Research</span><span>Alan Bond</span>
        <span class="heading">Consultant</span><span>Florian van Zandwijk</span>
        <span></span><span></span>
        <span class="heading">3D Assets</span><span>530 Degres</span>
        <span class="heading">IG Content</span><span>Vincent Labas</span>
        <span class="heading">Music</span><span>David Coehorst</span>
        <span class="heading">Sound Design</span><span>Andrés Aracena</span>
      </p>
      <a href="www.instagram.com/global_fandom" target="_blank" class="url">A project by Global Fandom in collaboration with Evertonian Alan Bond</a>
    </div>
    <div class="caption">
      <a href="https://contribute.goodison.memorial" target="_blank">Submit Your Memory</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<script>
const link = document.getElementById('about-link')!;
console.log(link);
let isActive = false;
link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  isActive = !isActive;
  link.classList.toggle('isActive', isActive);
  document.body.classList.toggle('isAboutActive', isActive);
});

window.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  if (!link.contains(e.target as Node)) {
    isActive = false;
    link.classList.remove('isActive');
    document.body.classList.remove('isAboutActive');
  }
});
</script>
<style>
header {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 12px 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  pointer-events: none;
  
  a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  
}

#about-link {
  pointer-events: all;
  cursor: pointer;

  &.isActive {
    pointer-events: auto;
    cursor: default;
  }
}

.title {
  @mixin button;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: left;
  max-width: 350px;
  padding: 8px 8px;
  max-height: 2em;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;

  h1 {
    @mixin button;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    pointer-events: auto;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  p {
    opacity: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    pointer-events: none;

    &:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }

  .table {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    column-gap: 0;
    row-gap: 0.5em;
    margin-top: 8px;

    a {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
    }
    svg {
      height: 1em;
      margin-left: 0.25em;
      width: 1em;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
  }
  
  .caption {
    background: #FFFFFF0D;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + 1em);
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: max-content;
    padding: 0.5em;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    pointer-events: none;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px 0px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .url { 
    display: block;
    margin: 0.5em auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  &.isActive {
    background: #FFFFFF0D;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    max-height: initial;
    overflow: visible;
    p {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    
    .caption {
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
  }

  .heading {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
}
</style>